'''Elementalist [[Tyrian armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign and is also available in the Factions campaign and Eye of the North expansion. This armor is called '''Elementalist''' up to maximum armor level in Droknar's Forge where it is instead called Tyrian armor.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Tyrian armor.

